			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b3c2fd42-e0e8-5a26-a065-484bd1a5d6b2")
	)
	(text
		"USB-C VBUS 5 V max 5.25 V. Order: fuse (0.5 A hold) -> TVS (6.0 V standoff) -> +5V. No reverse-polarity stage: a Type-C receptacle cannot be mated reversed, and one would only add drop ahead of the LDO. D7 and D8 are ESD arrays on the data and CC lines."
		(at 17.8 113.11 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9afcca1e-bf21-510a-a76b-6d95acac2a42")
	)
	(text
		"CC1 and CC2 each 5.1k to ground: sink, 5 V only."
		(at 17.8 115.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d70523aa-73c2-5210-976a-d64c581f6879")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 19.07 222.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "742ac38d-d5dc-510e-8d8c-65d56b92fdda")
	)
	(text
		"D+ and D- from the receptacle through 22 ohm series resistors to PA12 and PA11."
		(at 19.07 226.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a7d6ecb0-fe6b-5b74-b33d-db3ebc4a5bc9")
	)
	(text
		"R40 1.5k pulls D+ (MCU side) to 3V3: the STM32F103 USB peripheral has no internal pull-up, and the host detects a full-speed device only through it."
		(at 19.07 228.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "607297e4-b9d7-5c49-8ff8-c30b68078baa")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 18.86 360.57 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c3c7f7f7-d29c-59fa-b8c0-1943e9a43c26")
	)
	(text
		"STM32F103C8T6 on 3V3. Streams the bitstream to flash U2 over SPI1 (135,183 byte bitstream > 64 KB MCU flash)."
		(at 18.86 364.57 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8c161f29-268a-5515-a17d-03863f4f9d16")
	)
	(text
		"8 MHz JYJE 3TJ480000FYLBC, CL 8 pF, ESR 150 ohm max, C0 5 pF max; assumed stray 3 pF: C = 2 x (8 - 3) = 10 pF each."
		(at 18.86 367.11 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "206efca3-d62a-559a-8754-2648068073c7")
	)
	(text
		"SWD header: 3V3, SWDIO, SWCLK, NRST, GND."
		(at 18.86 369.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a83a0a5f-7c20-5f7b-a7eb-111c49886db6")
	)
