				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d3d31316-df03-5158-bec0-6005777c3768")
	)
	(text
		"Power, CDONE and two user LEDs, 1k each: about 1.3 mA at 3.3 V. The CDONE LED is driven through N-FET Q2 (gate on CDONE), so the open-drain CDONE net sees only a gate, not the LED."
		(at 511.73 466.17 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1da8195a-8244-57f1-982e-40d46554c6ad")
	)
